&lt;li&gt;Collegiate project team or laboratory experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently enrolled in an undergrad or graduate engineering program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CAD skills (any platform) and ability to make high quality engineering drawings that meet common industry standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated hands-on fabrication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High competence with, and fluid use of, engineering first principles.&lt;/li&gt;
