&lt;li&gt;Experience in NX/Teamcenter and/or Solidworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with FEA and/or CFD analysis tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to integrate electrical components into designs (motors, controllers, sensors etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with machining, sheet metal, injection molding, and 3D printing.&lt;/li&gt;
